VALUES (4400093534050127, ARRAY['"[8 marks] Explain Introduction to Linux in the context of Linux. Define it, describe its key principles or steps, and give one relevant example."'::jsonb, '"[8 marks] Explain Process in the context of Process Management. Define it, describe its key principles or steps, and give one relevant example."'::jsonb, '"[8 marks] Explain Contiguous Memory Allocation in the context of Memory Management. Define it, describe its key principles or steps, and give one relevant example."'::jsonb, '"[8 marks] Explain File-Concept of file in the context of File Management and Disk Structure. Define it, describe its key principles or steps, and give one relevant example."'::jsonb]::jsonb[], ARRAY[]::jsonb[], ARRAY['"Model answer (8 marks)\n\n**Meaning and purpose (2 marks):** Introduction to Linux is covered under “Linux”. An appropriate explanation should define its role, describe its main components or steps, connect it to Linux installation, Editing files with vi, vim, gcc, give a practical example, and state one limitation or verification check.\n\n**Principles/steps (3 marks):** Explain the concept in logical order and connect it to related syllabus points such as Linux installation; Editing files with vi; vim; gcc. State relevant assumptions, rules, components or formulas.\n\n**Application/example (2 marks):** Apply it to a concrete Operating System problem. Identify the objective, explain the procedure, and state the expected result.\n\n**Verification/conclusion (1 mark):** Check the result against the objective; mention a limitation, error source or trade-off. Conclude why the approach fits the task.\n\nMarking guide: definition/purpose 2; principles/steps 3; application/example 2; verification/conclusion 1."'::jsonb, '"Model answer (8 marks)\n\n**Meaning and purpose (2 marks):** Process is covered under “Process Management”. An appropriate explanation should define its role, describe its main components or steps, connect it to Process States, Process Control Block, Threads, User Level and Kernel level thread, give a practical example, and state one limitation or verification check.\n\n**Principles/steps (3 marks):** Explain the concept in logical order and connect it to related syllabus points such as Process States; Process Control Block; Threads; User Level and Kernel level thread. State relevant assumptions, rules, components or formulas.\n\n**Application/example (2 marks):** Apply it to a concrete Operating System problem. Identify the objective, explain the procedure, and state the expected result.\n\n**Verification/conclusion (1 mark):** Check the result against the objective; mention a limitation, error source or trade-off. Conclude why the approach fits the task.\n\nMarking guide: definition/purpose 2; principles/steps 3; application/example 2; verification/conclusion 1."'::jsonb, '"Model answer (8 marks)\n\n**Meaning and purpose (2 marks):** Contiguous Memory Allocation is covered under “Memory Management”. An appropriate explanation should define its role, describe its main components or steps, connect it to Swapping, Compaction, Partitioning Algorithm-First fit, Best fit, give a practical example, and state one limitation or verification check.\n\n**Principles/steps (3 marks):** Explain the concept in logical order and connect it to related syllabus points such as Swapping; Compaction; Partitioning Algorithm-First fit; Best fit. State relevant assumptions, rules, components or formulas.\n\n**Application/example (2 marks):** Apply it to a concrete Operating System problem. Identify the objective, explain the procedure, and state the expected result.\n\n**Verification/conclusion (1 mark):** Check the result against the objective; mention a limitation, error source or trade-off. Conclude why the approach fits the task.\n\nMarking guide: definition/purpose 2; principles/steps 3; application/example 2; verification/conclusion 1."'::jsonb, '"Model answer (8 marks)\n\n**Meaning and purpose (2 marks):** File-Concept of file is covered under “File Management and Disk Structure”. An appropriate explanation should define its role, describe its main components or steps, connect it to attributes and operations of file, file accessing methods, directories, file sharing and protection, give a practical example, and state one limitation or verification check.\n\n**Principles/steps (3 marks):** Explain the concept in logical order and connect it to related syllabus points such as attributes and operations of file; file accessing methods; directories; file sharing and protection. State relevant assumptions, rules, components or formulas.\n\n**Application/example (2 marks):** Apply it to a concrete Operating System problem. Identify the objective, explain the procedure, and state the expected result.\n\n**Verification/conclusion (1 mark):** Check the result against the objective; mention a limitation, error source or trade-off. Conclude why the approach fits the task.\n\nMarking guide: definition/purpose 2; principles/steps 3; application/example 2; verification/conclusion 1."'::jsonb]::jsonb[]);

